## `spec` fields

One person across systems, used to attribute runs to the human who drove them.

These are the top-level fields of the Identity spec, the same as `spec:` in YAML. Nested objects are described in the
server's JSON Schema at `GET /v1/schemas` (also used by the UI builder for validation).

| Field | Type | | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `display_name` | string | optional |  |
| `email` | string | optional |  |
| `github` | string | optional | GitHub login. |
| `jira_account_id` | string | optional |  |
| `slack_id` | string | optional |  |
| `actors` | list of string | optional | Shoal actors that are this person, e.g. 'user:dana@acme.com'. |
| `github_token_secret` | string | optional | Secret holding the user's linked GitHub OAuth token. |

